{"speciesId":818,"names":{"fr":"Lézargus","es":"Inteleon","en":"Inteleon","ja":"インテレオン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il a plus d’un tour dans son sac : il peut tirer des gerbes d’eau du bout de ses doigts et planer dans les airs grâce à ses membranes dorsales."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Esconde algunos trucos bajo la manga: puede disparar agua por los dedos o planear con las membranas de su espalda."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"多彩な 機能を 隠し持つ。 指から 水を 噴射して 背中の 皮膜で 風に 乗る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il repère le point faible de l’ennemi grâce à sa membrane nictitante, puis il transperce sa cible en tirant des jets d’eau à Mach 3 du bout des doigts."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Dispara chorros de agua por la punta de los dedos a 3 mach de velocidad. Con su membrana nictitante puede ver los puntos débiles del rival."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes’ weak points so it can precisely blast them with water that shoots from its fingertips at Mach 3."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"指先から 放つ 水鉄砲は マッハ３の 速さ。 瞬膜で 急所を 見抜いて 撃ちぬくぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":818,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"level-up",62],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",62],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine